        <div class="principles">
          <article class="principle"><span class="principle-number">01 / DEFINE</span><h3>Make intent precise</h3><p>Clear requirements, edge cases, and domain constraints will guide increasingly capable coding tools.</p></article>
          <article class="principle"><span class="principle-number">02 / VERIFY</span><h3>Earn trust with evidence</h3><p>Testing, formal methods, code review, and failure analysis remain essential when generated code can look convincing.</p></article>
