            </div>
            <p class="interests"><strong>Into:</strong> Full-stack development and gaming</p>

            <h4>A little about me</h4>
            <p class="detail">
              I’ll patiently sit through a 40-hour story-driven game with zero skips,
              but waiting 30 seconds for a build pipeline to finish tests my entire sanity.
            </p>

            <h4>AI in software engineering today</h4>
            <p class="detail">
              AI is unmatched for boilerplate and syntax lookups, but can hallucinate
              subtle logical flaws that make debugging twice as tedious. It speeds up
              typing without truly understanding architecture or context; right now,
